worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker.js"
  ceiling 89
  rationale "The worker entry (issue #1138 moved it from src/web/ to js/worker/): it bootstraps the mirror by loading the module list rather than belonging to it, so it owns no solver logic of its own and its line count moves only when bootstrapping does. Issue #1580 adds one required seed-record reader prerequisite import; the entry still contains no solver logic."
